00:18:22.851 --> 00:18:24.686
is that--

00:18:24.686 --> 00:18:26.321
look at what I'm plotting here.

00:18:26.321 --> 00:18:29.458
Maybe something-- that's
size squared, right?

00:18:29.458 --> 00:18:34.029
So it's only the square
of the wave function

00:18:34.029 --> 00:18:38.767
that we can relate any
physical meaning to.

00:18:38.767 --> 00:18:41.336
The physical meaning
I just related to you

00:18:41.336 --> 00:18:44.073
is the probability
of being somewhere.

00:18:44.073 --> 00:18:46.542
That's what size squared
gives us-- the probability

00:18:46.542 --> 00:18:48.210
of being somewhere.

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:49.945
But ask your teacher--

00:18:49.945 --> 00:18:53.015
not me, your quantum teacher.

00:18:53.015 --> 00:18:55.050
Ask what psi means.

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:56.385
And they're going to have a--

00:18:56.385 --> 00:18:58.954
it's going to be an
