00:18:58.954 --> 00:18:59.788
Force the issue.

00:18:59.788 --> 00:19:03.725
Don't let them go
until they answer.

00:19:03.725 --> 00:19:05.127
We still don't know.

00:19:05.127 --> 00:19:07.162
We still don't know
what the actual wave

00:19:07.162 --> 00:19:09.765
