I got to do this.

00:38:03.264 --> 00:38:04.599
All right, all right.

00:38:04.599 --> 00:38:05.766
I got to go--

00:38:05.766 --> 00:38:06.467
I know.

00:38:06.467 --> 00:38:07.935
I got to go backwards here.

00:38:10.538 --> 00:38:12.106
OK, OK, hold on, hold on.

00:38:14.709 --> 00:38:16.344
I'm missing there
