00:38:16.344 --> 00:38:17.845
I got to work on my arm.

00:38:17.845 --> 00:38:18.713
Yeah.

00:38:18.713 --> 00:38:19.747
Show you love over there.

00:38:19.747 --> 00:38:21.515
OK, all right.

00:38:21.515 --> 00:38:25.519
I'll have more on Wednesday,
