00:38:29.123 --> 00:38:31.392
but I couldn't help myself.

00:38:31.392 --> 00:38:32.860
It's extremely exciting.

00:38:32.860 --> 00:38:35.329
This is, after all,
solid-state chemistry,

00:38:35.329 --> 00:38:37.398
and Wednesday we're
